## Changes Made

### 1. Removed `font-mono` from the Root Div (`HomePage.jsx`)

**Before:**
```jsx
<div className="min-h-screen bg-white text-slate-800 font-mono antialiased">
```
**After:**
```jsx
<div className="min-h-screen bg-white text-slate-800 antialiased">
```
`font-sans` is already applied in `Layout.jsx` on the outer wrapper, so this was redundant and harmful.

---

### 2. Added Dual CTAs in the Hero Section (`HomePage.jsx`)

Replaced the single anchor button with two:
- **Primary:** "Start Learning" → scrolls to `#learn-with-me`, blue filled, has an `ArrowRight` icon with a slide-right animation on hover
- **Secondary:** "View my projects" → scrolls to `#projects`, white ghost style with a border that highlights on hover

```jsx
<div className="flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
  <a href="#learn-with-me" className="bg-[#6ab3ea] ... flex items-center group">
    Start Learning
    <ArrowRight className="ml-2 w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-200" />
  </a>
  <a href="#projects" className="bg-white border border-slate-300 hover:border-[#6ab3ea] ...">
    View my projects
  </a>
</div>
```

> **Note:** `flex-wrap` was used instead of `flex` to prevent buttons from overflowing on small screens.

---

### 3. Added Section Subtitles (`HomePage.jsx`)

Both the "Courses" and "My Projects" headings now have a short descriptor `<p>` beneath them styled `text-slate-500 text-center max-w-xl`.

**Courses subtitle:**
> *"Structured, self-paced learning paths designed for university students in Rwanda."*

**My Projects subtitle:**
> *"A selection of what I've built — from backend APIs to AI-powered tools."*

---

### 4. Overhauled "Why Learn With Us?" Section (`HomePage.jsx`)

This was the biggest change. The paragraph+list combo was completely replaced.

**Structural change:**
- Removed: one `<p>` block with 4 `<br/>`-separated sentences + a `<ul>` with 3 numbered items
- Added: a `grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4` containing **4 icon-backed feature cards**

**Each card structure:**
```jsx
<div className="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-[#e6f3fb] shadow-sm
                hover:shadow-md hover:border-[#6ab3ea] transition-all duration-200 group">
  <div className="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#e6f3fb] flex items-center justify-center
                  text-[#2f7fb5] group-hover:bg-[#2f7fb5] group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
    <IconName className="w-5 h-5" />
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3 className="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">Card Title</h3>
    <p className="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-snug">Short description.</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

**Icons used (from `lucide-react`):**

| Card | Icon | Title |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `Target` | Personalized Learning |
| 2 | `Zap` | Interactive & Engaging |
| 3 | `Globe` | 24/7 Access |
| 4 | `ShieldCheck` | Private & Secure |

**Import line updated to:**
```jsx
import { Github, ArrowRight, Target, Zap, Globe, ShieldCheck } from "lucide-react";
```

**Hover effect:** The icon container transitions from `bg-[#e6f3fb] text-[#2f7fb5]` → `bg-[#2f7fb5] text-white` on card hover, using Tailwind's `group` / `group-hover` pattern.

---

### 5. Fixed the Illustration Placeholder (`HomePage.jsx`)

**Before:** The image was nested inside a dashed-border `div` that still rendered a floating SVG icon beside it.

**After:** The placeholder wrapper was removed entirely. The image renders standalone with `drop-shadow-md`:
```jsx
<img
  src="/undraw_education_1.png"
  alt="Education illustration"
  className="w-full max-w-sm object-contain drop-shadow-md"
/>
```

---

### 6. Decoupled Logo & Nav in the Header (`Layout.jsx`)

**Before:** Logo and nav shared one `flex space-x-2 md:space-x-8` div — tight on mobile.

**After:** They are siblings in a `flex items-center gap-6 md:gap-10` container, with the logo getting `flex-shrink-0` to prevent it from being compressed.

```jsx
<div className="flex items-center gap-6 md:gap-10">
  <Link to="/" className="flex items-center hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity flex-shrink-0">
    <img src="/gasigwa-logo.png" className="h-12 md:h-16 w-auto object-contain" />
  </Link>
  <nav className="flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-2">
    {/* nav links */}
  </nav>
</div>
```

Nav link classes were also cleaned up — removed unnecessary `block` and added `text-sm md:text-base` for responsive sizing.

---

## Design Patterns Established

- **Feature card pattern:** `group` on the card container + `group-hover:` on the icon div enables icon color transitions without JS
- **Section headings:** Always pair an `<h2>` with a `<p className="text-slate-500 ...">` subtitle for professional polish
- **Dual CTA pattern:** Primary (filled blue) + Secondary (ghost/border) side-by-side using `flex-wrap gap-3`
- **Color palette reference:**
  - Primary blue: `#2f7fb5`
  - Light blue / hover tint: `#6ab3ea`
  - Icon background: `#e6f3fb`
  - Border accent: `#e6f3fb` at rest → `#6ab3ea` on hover
